# The settings of the web app, read at build time. Copy this file to .env.local for a build of your own; the app checks
# each value as it starts and stops with the reason when one is missing. .env.development and .env.production hold the
# values of the two builds of Kranox.
# The address of the relay, such as https://relay.kranox.cash, or http://127.0.0.1:8787 for a relay on this machine.
VITE_RELAY_URL=
# The public keys of the relay, separated by commas: the uncompressed point of P-256 in base64, 65 bytes that start
# with 4. The app trusts no answer of the relay without a signature under one of them.
VITE_RELAY_SIGNING_KEYS=
